 "description": "Show ready styles/copies with content format (faceless/motion/talking), frame formats, jobs, best_for, actual inputs and saved style_version when available. Motion is faceless type/music with inputs.voice:none by default; an explicit voiceover request overrides that default while keeping the visual style and aligns visuals to the recorded speech. Narrated faceless styles use inputs.voice:narrator. Also returns all 21 narrator descriptions, accent/tags and public audition URLs; use catalog names in create_video voice. Recommend suitable returned styles, never invent private IDs. Listen/show auditions before selecting an undecided voice.",
